{"path":"links","title":"Useful resources","titleHtml":"Useful resources","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/links","section":"","kind":"index","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"C_FAQs\">C FAQs</h3>\n<ul><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://c-faq.com/\" data-external=\"1\">C FAQ</a> — Answers to the frequently asked questions from the Usenet newsgroup <b>comp.lang.c</b>.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"C_Language_and_library_references\">C Language and library references</h3>\n<ul><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg14/\" data-external=\"1\">JTC1/SC22/WG14</a> — The C Standards Committee, includes draft C language standards, proposals, and defect reports.\n<ul><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://port70.net/~nsz/c/c89/c89-draft.html\" data-external=\"1\">c89</a> — C89 draft (html).\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://open-std.org/JTC1/SC22/WG14/www/docs/n1124.pdf\" data-external=\"1\">n1124.pdf</a> — C99 draft (with TC1 and TC2).\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://open-std.org/JTC1/SC22/WG14/www/docs/n1256.pdf\" data-external=\"1\">n1256.pdf</a> — C99 draft (with TC1, TC2, and TC3).\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://open-std.org/JTC1/SC22/WG14/www/docs/n1570.pdf\" data-external=\"1\">n1570.pdf</a> — C11 final working draft.\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://files.lhmouse.com/standards/ISO%20C%20N2176.pdf\" data-external=\"1\">n2176 (C17 FDIS)</a> — C17/C18 final draft.\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://open-std.org/JTC1/SC22/WG14/www/docs/n3220.pdf\" data-external=\"1\">n3220.pdf</a> — C23 first post-publication draft (contains <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg14/www/docs/n3221.htm\" data-external=\"1\">editorial fixes to C23</a> only).\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://open-std.org/JTC1/SC22/WG14/www/docs/n3435.pdf\" data-external=\"1\">n3435.pdf</a> — C latest public working draft (2025-01-03).\n</li></ul>\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/m/?hl=en#!forum/comp.std.c\" data-external=\"1\">comp.std.c</a> — Discussion about C language standards.\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/gnu-c-manual/gnu-c-manual.html\" data-external=\"1\">GNU C Manual</a> — C core language reference as implemented by the GNU C compiler.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"C_ABIs\">C ABIs</h3>\n<ul><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/hjl-tools/x86-psABI/wiki/X86-psABI\" data-external=\"1\">System V ABI</a> — For x86-64, Intel386, and IA MCU architectures.\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/x64-calling-convention\" data-external=\"1\">Windows x64 ABI</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nxp.com.cn/docs/en/application-note/PPCEABI.pdf\" data-external=\"1\">PowerPC EABI</a> — For 32-bit embedded processors.\n</li><li> PowerOpen ABI — For older PowerPC platforms.\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/ARM-software/abi-aa/releases\" data-external=\"1\">ARM ABI</a> — For ARM architecture.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Related_standards\">Related standards</h3>\n<ul><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799/functions/contents.html\" data-external=\"1\">POSIX.1-2024/IEEE Std 1003.1-2024</a> — The operating system API of the Unix-compatible systems.\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/index.html\" data-external=\"1\">Linux man pages</a> — The Linux OS API documentation.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Open-source_implementations\">Open-source implementations</h3>\n<ul><li> Standard library implementations:\n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/lattera/glibc\" data-external=\"1\">GNU libc</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl/tree\" data-external=\"1\">MUSL</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=newlib-cygwin.git\" data-external=\"1\">Newlib</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bitbucket.org/pdclib/pdclib/src/\" data-external=\"1\">PDClib</a>\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<ul><li> Compilers:\n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/gcc-mirror/gcc\" data-external=\"1\">GCC</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project\" data-external=\"1\">LLVM Clang</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sdcc.sourceforge.net/\" data-external=\"1\">SDCC</a>\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<h3 id=\"Might_be_also_useful\">Might be also useful</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/c/links/libs\">List of C libraries</a>\n</li></ul>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/links\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span><span>External Links</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"C FAQs","id":"C_FAQs"},{"depth":3,"text":"C Language and library references","id":"C_Language_and_library_references"},{"depth":3,"text":"C ABIs","id":"C_ABIs"},{"depth":3,"text":"Related standards","id":"Related_standards"},{"depth":3,"text":"Open-source implementations","id":"Open-source_implementations"},{"depth":3,"text":"Might be also useful","id":"Might_be_also_useful"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"}],"children":[{"path":"links/libs","title":"A list of open source C libraries"}],"map":{"label":"Useful resources","children":[{"label":"C FAQs","children":[{"label":"comp.lang.c"}]},{"label":"C Language and library references"},{"label":"C ABIs"},{"label":"Related standards"},{"label":"Open-source implementations"},{"label":"Might be also useful"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":206,"codeBlockCount":0}
